  m_Name: Bidzina Chkonia
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SuspectData
  FirstName: Bidzina
  LastName: Chkhonia
  Nickname: The Gambler
  Occupation: Card Player
  CharacterDescription: 'Nervous, twitchy, avoids direct answers. A man who lives and breathes probability. He has a nervous energy, constantly fiddling with a coin or a deck of cards. '
  CharacterArc: "He treats the entire checkpoint process\u2014and the apocalypse itself\u2014as a high-stakes game of chance. He isn't necessarily sad about the world ending; he\u2019s just annoyed that the odds are no longer in his favor."
  DateOfBirth: 09/09/1965
  Sex: Male
  EntryPermitExpiryDate: 14 AUG
